TODO: bootstrap artifact versioning

Current installer updates bootstrap resources only if they are missing.

This is acceptable during initial development but can leave stale
compiled resources on the target.

Future improvement:

Option 1 (preferred)
- Store a bootstrap version manifest.
- Compare version numbers.
- Update only when bundled version is newer.

Option 3
- Development mode:
    always overwrite bootstrap resources.
- Release mode:
    version based updates.

Goal:
Automatic, reliable bootstrap updates without unnecessary SD card writes.